/T (Trollhaugen is much more than a place. It is a community built over generations by people who gave of their time, talents, energy, and hearts. Many of those we remember helped build traditions that continue to shape the experience of every camper who comes to camp. Some taught us Scandinavian crafts and folk traditions. Some led activities, prepared meals, organized events, or simply offered a kind word and welcoming smile or attended as campers.  )
