<<
/Title (The board would like to extend our heartfelt thanks to each and every one of you for being part of this year's camp experience. Your enthusiasm, energy, and positive spirit helped create a truly memorable week filled with learning, laughter, and friendship. Whether you were trying something new, encouraging a fellow camper, volunteering your time, or simply showing up with a great attitude each day, you contributed to making our camp community a special place.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 555 0 R
/Next 563 0 R
>>
