<<
/Title (Each year, we come together to celebrate Scandinavian culture, traditions, heritage, and community. We share stories, laughter, songs, crafts, meals, and memories. We honor the customs that connect us to our past and to one another. At camp this year we gathered to recognize those we have lost.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
