<<
/Title (A sincere thank you also goes out to our families, volunteers, and staff members. Your support, dedication, and trust make everything we do possible. The countless hours spent planning activities, ensuring safety, providing encouragement, and creating meaningful experiences do not go unnoticed. We are grateful for the opportunity to spend this time together and are proud of the friendships, accomplishments, and memories that were made. We hope you leave camp with lasting connections and stories to share, and we look forward to welcoming you back again in the future.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 555 0 R
